# Dev-time only: the analyzer benchmark harness and the Ollama Modelfile are not
# shipped in any image. The Python images COPY only requirements.txt, shared/,
# and their own app/, so these never reach a layer regardless; excluding them
# here keeps the build context lean and makes the intent explicit.
